<h2 id="清涼一夏古人如何消暑">清涼一夏─古人如何消暑</h2>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260802_104916_145.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
