<hr>
<h1 id="竹塘九龍大榕公">竹塘九龍大榕公</h1>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_101528_974.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<p><img alt="無法載入" loading="lazy" src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_102835_579.jpg"></p>
<p>超級茂密的榕樹！號稱佔地 3000 坪！我看牌子寫樹齡大約 120 歲，不愧是大自然的力量。看起來只有我們是特別跑來的觀光客，樹下都是長輩在唱卡啦 OK，還有不少在地狗狗在散步。</p>
<hr>
<h1 id="瑞春醬油觀光工廠">瑞春醬油觀光工廠</h1>
<p><img alt="無法載入" loading="lazy" src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/1785661879097.jpg"></p>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/1785713613471.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_111257_635.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<p>避免無聊，我拿了小冊子收集工廠內的印章，還吃了「黑豆醬油冰淇淋」！老實說不太好吃，一個甜點怎麼會是鹹的呢？不過我特別喜歡黑豆（日本蜜黑豆），而冰裡面的還算好咬，所以最後還是吃掉了。</p>
<hr>
<h1 id="丸莊醬油觀光工廠">丸莊醬油觀光工廠</h1>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_114718_755.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>我喜歡<a href="/posts/tile">建築</a>，這座鐘樓不錯看！</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_115346_650.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>酷。</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_120052_119.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>原來<a href="/posts/investment-scam">股票</a>原本長這樣！</p></blockquote>
<hr>
<h1 id="琴連碗粿城">琴連碗粿城</h1>
<p>午餐去丸莊醬油隔壁吃。我點了正常版的碗粿，媽媽點「黑糖紅豆碗粿」，又是一個反差的東西，一道鹹的料理不應該是甜的！好在「咖啡碗粿」賣完了，否則又是一番折騰！</p>
<hr>
<h1 id="詔安客家文化館">詔安客家文化館</h1>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_132002_516.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_131417_400.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<p>我覺得很沒誠意的一間！東西又少，位置又偏僻！只有建築設計還不錯，房子有兩棟，用空橋連接，圍成中庭，外牆的鐵網讓我想起<a href="/posts/library">綠美圖</a>。</p>
<hr>
<h1 id="千巧谷牛樂園牧場">千巧谷牛樂園牧場</h1>
<p><img alt="無法載入" loading="lazy" src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/1785713653893.jpg"></p>
<blockquote>
<p>跟外公外婆大合照！</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_134554_613.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>看起來很好笑！</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_134840_898.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>必須白！這什麼鬼說明？</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_140111_533.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>好多鴨鴨🦆</p></blockquote>
<p><img alt="無法載入" loading="lazy" src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/signal-2026-08-02-18-40-10-946.jpg"></p>
<blockquote>
<p>我在餵牛。</p></blockquote>
<hr>
<h1 id="源順芝麻觀光油廠">源順芝麻觀光油廠</h1>
<p><img alt="無法載入" loading="lazy" src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_151857_351.jpg"></p>
<blockquote>
<p>套印<a href="/posts/postcard">明信片</a>。我覺得我很會拍照。</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_150150_037.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p><a href="/posts/tainan">埃及</a>人也用芝麻啊！</p></blockquote>
<hr>
<h1 id="馬鳴山鎮安宮五年千歲祖廟">馬鳴山鎮安宮五年千歲祖廟</h1>
<p>裡面有主題公園，好像迷宮一樣，我們沒有全部走完。今天的運動量達標了！</p>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_163218_962.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>抬頭烏龜。</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_163732_714.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>好像千佛洞喔，雖然我沒去過。</p></blockquote>
<p><img alt="無法載入" loading="lazy" src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_165404_161.jpg"></p>
<blockquote>
<p>姜太公釣魚。</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_165547_871.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>摩天大橋（取這名字，反正他高興就好）上的風景。</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_165755_492.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>長得好像 Groot。</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_170030_047.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>我屬豬，當然要跟豬拍照啊🐷</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_170503_622.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>🐖🐖🐖</p></blockquote>
<hr>
<h1 id="三條崙海清宮">三條崙海清宮</h1>
<p>總算進入今天的重點——三條崙海清宮香客大樓！平均一人五百就能享受到超大坪數房間，浴室乾淨，床也還算舒服。</p>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260802_071049_082.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_180101_055.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260801_182140_285.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>很像膠囊旅館，雖然我沒住過。</p></blockquote>
<img src="https://pub-cbe0ce0485dd4255ac47a58d28e50e0d.r2.dev/IMG_20260802_072852_993.jpg" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
<blockquote>
<p>扁掉的包公😆</p></blockquote>
<p>晚上吃完合菜後，我們就回房休息。我八點洗澡，<a href="/posts/morning">九點就睡了</a>，跟平時差不多。</p>
<p>這種休眠艙的設計，最大的缺點就是無法通風！我彷彿住在巨型抽屜裡面！於是我決定不拉窗簾，反正也沒什麼隔音效果；我也不怕人看，因為我選最角落的位置，隱密又安靜！</p>
<hr>
<p>第二天看這邊：<a href="/posts/yunlin1">雲嘉二日遊（二）</a></p>
